{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nLog tail for the selected container, and the reusable tail component that the Actions log pane will also use.\n\n## Spec\n- `docker logs --tail <n> --timestamps` fetched in the background; on a tick, fetch `--since <last timestamp>` and append (follow mode)\n- Shared `TailPane` component in `src/core/ui/`: scrollback buffer with a cap, follow-on/off (auto-scroll to the end; any manual scroll pauses following, `G` resumes), `/` search with match highlighting, `Ctrl+d` / `Ctrl+u`\n- stderr and stdout interleaved as docker emits them; ANSI escapes stripped\n- Not a place to filter secrets: the user is explicitly looking at the log\n\nPart of #87.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:17Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":92,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Docker: logs pane (shared tail component)"}
